 new('activation-heuristics','激活率与复杂度的近似解释','Approximate activation-rate interpretation','Eq.(2) discussion; Appendix B.4/C/D',r'C_l=\sum_d h(a_l^d)',[5,15,16],'empirical')
 source('activation-heuristics','C',T['C']['original_proof_md']+'\n\n'+T['D']['original_proof_md'],[16],r'The average activation rate is considered roughly constant after convergence, so $C_l$ is considered roughly constant. Appendix B.4 instead considers DNNs with similar coordinate activation rates $a_l^d$; Appendix C discusses the conditional term $C_{l\mid Y}$ and exceptions, and Appendix D gives intuitive feature-entanglement examples.')
 new('external-theorems','引述的计算复杂度与表示能力结论','Cited computational and representation complexity results','Section2 external results',r'\text{NP-hardness, fixed-input-dimension learning and depth-dependent maximal complexity}',[2,3],'external_theorem_scope')
 get('external-theorems')['original_statement_md']=r'Blum & Rivest (1989) proved that learning a one-layer network with a sign activation function was NP-hard. Livni et al. (2014) further discussed computational complexity with other activation functions. Boob et al. (2018) and Manurangsi & Reichman (2018) proved that learning a two-layer ReLU network was also NP-hard. Arora et al. (2016) showed that a ReLU network with one hidden layer could be learned in polynomial time when the input dimension was constant. Raghu et al. (2017) proved that maximal feature complexity grew exponentially with DNN depth. Liang et al. (2017) and Cortes et al. (2017) applied Rademacher complexity to estimate maximal representation capacity. These are explicit source attributions, with no local proofs in this paper.'
 # Local rewritten proof definitions and premises.
 affine_ass=[(r'有限层链，各层宽度可不同。固定该输入实际触发的ReLU/dropout/池化选择矩阵；每层线性算子与偏置维度相容。可选softmax $g$不在仿射模块结论内。',r'A finite chain may have different layer widths. Fix the ReLU/dropout/pooling selection matrices actually triggered by the input, with compatible linear maps and biases. The optional softmax $g$ is outside the affine-module conclusion.')]
 spec('gating-affine',affine_ass,[(r'将固定门吸收进相邻线性算子$A_j$，递推$t_{j+1}=A_jt_j+b_j$；$F_j$是前j层仿射复合，$F_0(x)=x$。',r'Absorb fixed gates into the adjacent linear maps $A_j$ and write $t_{j+1}=A_jt_j+b_j$. Let $F_j$ be the first j affine layers, with $F_0(x)=x$.')],[step('固定门的线性作用','Fix the linear gate action',r'ReLU恒等式$max(0,h_d)=1_{h_d>0}h_d$逐坐标给对角门矩阵。dropout取固定0/1掩码；池化在每个窗口固定一个达到最大值的索引，平局可任选一个最大者。因此当前门模式作用是线性的。',r'The coordinate identity $\max(0,h_d)=1_{h_d>0}h_d$ gives a diagonal ReLU gate. Dropout fixes a binary mask; pooling selects an index attaining the maximum in each window, with any maximizer allowed at a tie. The action of this fixed gate pattern is linear.'),step('复合线性项与偏置','Compose the linear part and bias',r'若$F_j(x)=B_jx+c_j$，则下一层$F_{j+1}(x)=A_jB_jx+A_jc_j+b_j$。归纳涵盖任意有限层数与不同宽度；等效偏置就是$F_L(0)$，无需把原网络偏置设为0。',r'If $F_j(x)=B_jx+c_j$, then $F_{j+1}(x)=A_jB_jx+A_jc_j+b_j$. Induction covers any finite depth and varying widths. The equivalent bias is $F_L(0)$; the original network bias is retained.',r'F_L(x)=(F_L)_{\rm lin}x+F_L(0)',['Harsanyi.GatedAffine.layer_comp','Harsanyi.GatedAffine.network_output_affine','Harsanyi.GatedAffine.network_output_linear_bias'])],('固定门下完整仿射层链已形式化；门矩阵的ReLU/池化构造在人读步骤中给出，Lean范围为其吸收后的实际线性算子层链。','The complete affine chain at fixed gates is formalized. ReLU/pooling gate construction is given in the readable steps; Lean covers the resulting chain of actual linear maps.'),evidence='partial_component')
 finite_ass=[(r'原网络的门变量有限离散，所有条件/联合律来自同一分布；层前缀/后缀使用相同样本，不要求每个门模式出现。',r'Gate variables of the network are finite and discrete. All conditional and joint laws belong to the same distribution; prefixes and suffixes use the same samples, without requiring every gate pattern to occur.')]
 deterministic=[(r'无额外采样/dropout；给定所指输入或中间特征后，所指全部后继门由固定网络确定。标签有限，概率核可测；输入/中间特征可连续。',r'There is no additional sampling/dropout. The specified input or intermediate feature determines all specified subsequent gates in the fixed network. Labels are finite and atom kernels measurable; input and intermediate features may be continuous.')]
 chainsteps=[step('分解联合概率','Split joint probabilities',r'正边缘质量的行满足$p(a,b)=p(a)p(b\mid a)$；逐项分解$-p(a,b)\log p(a,b)$并求和。零边缘质量迫使该行所有联合原子为0，因此贡献0。',r'For a positive-mass conditioning row, $p(a,b)=p(a)p(b\mid a)$. Split each term $-p(a,b)\log p(a,b)$ and sum. A zero-mass marginal forces every joint atom in that row to zero, so its contribution is zero.',r'H(A,B)=H(A)+H(B\mid A)',['entropy_chain','mass_zero_of_marginal_zero']),step('逐层使用链式规则','Apply the chain rule at each layer',r'把$A$取为已加入的门前缀、$B$取为下一门层，重复二变量恒等式得到原L层展开。$-p\log p\ge0$还保证每个条件熵非负。Lean验证每一次任意有限门扩展；L次展开是该恒等式的有限迭代。',r'Take $A$ as the gate prefix and $B$ as the next gate layer. Repeating the two-variable identity gives the source L-layer expansion. Each conditional entropy is nonnegative because $-p\log p\ge0$. Lean verifies each arbitrary finite extension; the L-layer expansion is its finite iteration.',r'H(\Sigma)=\sum_l H(\Sigma_l\mid\Sigma_{1:l-1})',['conditional_entropy_nonneg'])]
 spec('entropy-chain',finite_ass,[LAW],chainsteps,('已验证任意有限联合表的二变量链式规则与非负条件熵；原任意L层迭代在人读证明完成，尚无单独L层递归声明。','The two-variable chain rule and nonnegative conditional entropy are verified for every finite joint table. The arbitrary L-layer iteration is completed in the readable proof, without a separate recursive L-layer declaration.'),evidence='partial_component')
 get('entropy-chain')['original_statement_md']=r'$H(\Sigma)$ is the entropy of gating states among all inputs, measuring the complexity of transformations encoded in gating layers. The complexity can be decomposed as $$H(\Sigma)=H(\Sigma_1)+H(\Sigma_2\mid\Sigma_1)+\cdots+H(\Sigma_L\mid\Sigma_1,\ldots,\Sigma_{L-1}).$$'
 zerostep=step('计算确定性门条件熵','Compute deterministic conditional gate entropy',r'给定$x$，门条件律是$f(x)$处的单点律；其唯一非零原子为1，熵为0。对任意输入分布积分仍为0。这一步使用真实条件核，不把待证的条件熵为0作为假设。',r'Given $x$, the conditional gate law is a point mass at $f(x)$. Its only nonzero atom is one, so its entropy is zero; integrating against any input law remains zero. This computes the actual kernel rather than assuming the desired zero entropy.',r'H(\Sigma\mid X)=\int0\,d\mu=0',['gate_label_entropy_zero','conditional_gate_entropy_zero'])
 spec('deterministic-input',deterministic,[LAW,GATE],[zerostep,step('代入输入信息定义','Substitute into input information',r'对于有限门输出，$I(X;\Sigma)=H(\Sigma)-H(\Sigma\mid X)$。上一步得第二项0，所以原值等于门熵；不对连续输入本身取离散熵。',r'For the finite gate output, $I(X;\Sigma)=H(\Sigma)-H(\Sigma\mid X)$. The second term is zero by the preceding kernel computation, giving the source equality without taking a discrete entropy of continuous input.',r'I(X;\Sigma)=H(\Sigma)')],('任意输入空间的条件门熵为0已验证；输入MI按该有限输出条件熵定义的最终代入是实数减0。','Zero conditional gate entropy is verified on arbitrary input spaces; the final substitution into finite-output input MI is real subtraction by zero.'),evidence='partial_component')
 get('deterministic-input')['original_statement_md']=r'$I(X;\Sigma)$ measures the complexity of transformations caused by the input. If the DNN does not use random sampling or dropout to introduce additional uncertainty not caused by the input, then $\Sigma$ is fully determined by $X$, i.e. $$H(\Sigma\mid X)=0,\quad I(X;\Sigma)=H(\Sigma)-H(\Sigma\mid X)=H(\Sigma).$$'
 costeps=[step('构造原联合门标签律','Construct the actual joint law',r'将标签条件核与确定性门组合，再按输入律积分：$p(y,\sigma)=\int k_x(y)1_{f(x)=\sigma}d\mu$。非负性和总质量1由每个$x$处的条件律及有限和与积分交换推出。',r'Combine the conditional label kernel with the deterministic gate and integrate over the input law: $p(y,\sigma)=\int k_x(y)1_{f(x)=\sigma}d\mu$. Nonnegativity and total mass one follow from the conditional law at each input and interchange of a finite sum with the integral.',r'p(y,\sigma)=\int k_x(y)1_{f(x)=\sigma}d\mu',['gateLabelLaw']),step('消去给定输入的条件信息','Eliminate conditional information given input',r'给定$x$后门恒定，联合律是标签条件律与单点门的乘积，因此$I(\Sigma;Y\mid X=x)=0$；积分得到$I(\Sigma;Y\mid X)=0$。按源Eq6–7同一co-information定义得$I(X;\Sigma;Y)=I(\Sigma;Y)$。',r'At each input the gate is constant, so the joint conditional law is the label kernel times a point-mass gate, with $I(\Sigma;Y\mid X=x)=0$. Its integral is zero. Using the same co-information convention as source Equations (6)–(7) gives $I(X;\Sigma;Y)=I(\Sigma;Y)$.',r'I(X;\Sigma;Y)=I(\Sigma;Y)',['gate_label_conditional_information_zero','deterministic_gate_co_information_eq']),step('用KL证明非负','Prove nonnegativity by KL',r'有限联合律上$I(\Sigma;Y)=D_{KL}(p_{\Sigma Y}\Vert p_\Sigma p_Y)$。正联合原子对应两个正边缘原子；Gibbs逐项不等式求和给KL非负，零联合原子贡献0。',r'For the finite joint law, $I(\Sigma;Y)=D_{KL}(p_{\Sigma Y}\Vert p_\Sigma p_Y)$. A positive joint atom has two positive corresponding marginals. Summing the Gibbs term inequality gives nonnegative KL; zero joint atoms contribute zero.',r'I(X;\Sigma;Y)\ge0',['mutual_information_nonneg','deterministic_gate_co_information_nonneg'])]
 spec('coinfo-nonnegative',deterministic,[LAW,GATE,CO],costeps,('Property1以真实确定性门条件核与实际积分联合律在任意输入空间形式化；不要求输入有限或有Shannon熵。','Property 1 is formalized using the actual deterministic gate kernel and integrated joint law on arbitrary input spaces, without requiring finite input or a Shannon entropy of input.'))
 for s,orientation in [('prefix-entropy','prefix'),('suffix-entropy','suffix')]:
  spec(s,finite_ass,[LAW],[step('确定嵌套门向量','Identify the nested gate vectors',r'较长门向量由较短向量$A$及被加入的一层$B$构成；后缀情形只交换变量顺序，熵不依赖该排列。两者是同一联合律的投影。',r'The longer gate vector consists of the shorter vector $A$ and one added layer $B$. In the suffix case, only the variable order changes, which does not change entropy. Both vectors are projections of the same joint law.'),step('比较条件熵差','Compare the conditional entropy difference',r'链式规则$H(A,B)-H(A)=H(B\mid A)$，且每个条件律熵非负，因此长门向量熵不小于短向量。原前缀≤和后缀≥均由此得到。',r'The chain rule gives $H(A,B)-H(A)=H(B\mid A)\ge0$, so the longer gate vector has at least the entropy of its projection. This gives the source prefix ≤ and suffix ≥ directions.',r'H(A)\le H(A,B)',['entropy_chain','entropy_marginal_le'])],('同一有限联合门律的投影熵单调性完整验证，适用于任意门数与层宽。','Entropy monotonicity for a projection of the same finite gate joint law is fully verified, for any number of gates and layer widths.'))
 for s in ['prefix-input','suffix-input']:
  spec(s,deterministic+finite_ass,[LAW,GATE],[zerostep,step('比较两个输入信息值','Compare both input-information values',r'前缀情形两个门向量由$X$确定；后缀情形$T_{l-1}$确定$\Sigma_{l:L}$而$T_l$确定$\Sigma_{l+1:L}$。各自输入MI都等于对应门熵，故应用较长向量熵不小于投影熵。',r'For prefixes, both gate vectors are determined by $X$. For suffixes, $T_{l-1}$ determines $\Sigma_{l:L}$ and $T_l$ determines $\Sigma_{l+1:L}$. Each input MI equals the corresponding gate entropy, so monotonicity follows from the entropy of a vector exceeding that of its projection.',r'H(A,B)\ge H(A)',['entropy_marginal_le'])],('真实确定性条件门熵及完整投影熵比较已验证；两个不同输入变量的MI定义代入在人读证明完成，未另立组合声明。','Actual zero conditional gate entropy and full projection entropy comparison are verified. Substitution into the MI definitions for the two input variables is completed in the readable proof without a separate combined declaration.'),evidence='partial_component')
 refstep=step('分解新增门的条件信息','Disintegrate added-gate conditional information',r'对实际联合门/标签律按旧门$A$取条件律。零质量行任取正规后备律，其权重为0；正行取$p(B,Y\mid A=a)$。逐项熵链展开得到$I(A,B;Y)-I(A;Y)=\sum_ap_a I(B;Y\mid A=a)\ge0$，未假定此关键等式。',r'Disintegrate the actual gate/label law by the old gate $A$. A zero-mass row uses an arbitrary normalized fallback multiplied by zero; a positive row uses $p(B,Y\mid A=a)$. Entropy chain expansion yields $I(A,B;Y)-I(A;Y)=\sum_ap_a I(B;Y\mid A=a)\ge0$, without assuming this key equality.',r'I(A,B;Y)-I(A;Y)=I(B;Y\mid A)\ge0',['kernel_disintegration','refined_information_difference','actual_projection_information_monotone'])
 for s in ['prefix-coinfo-main','suffix-coinfo']:
  spec(s,deterministic+finite_ass,[LAW,GATE,CO],[costeps[1],refstep,step('代回前缀或后缀','Apply the prefix or suffix direction',r'前缀是增加$B=\Sigma_{l+1}$，信息随之增加。后缀从$(\Sigma_l,\Sigma_{l+1:L})$删去$\Sigma_l$，故信息减少。无额外随机性使所指co-information等于这些有限门标签MI，即得正文Property2和附录Property3正确方向。',r'A prefix adds $B=\Sigma_{l+1}$ and therefore increases information. A suffix removes $\Sigma_l$ from $(\Sigma_l,\Sigma_{l+1:L})$ and therefore decreases information. Without extra randomness, the specified co-information equals these finite gate/label MIs, giving the correct main Property 2 and appendix Property 3 directions.',r'I(X;\Sigma_{1:l};Y)\le I(X;\Sigma_{1:l+1};Y)',['deterministic_gate_refinement_information'])],('以任意输入空间实际积分联合律及确定性条件核验证门细化co-information单调性；后缀按删除坐标应用同一声明。','Co-information monotonicity under gate refinement is verified from the actual integrated joint law and deterministic kernel on arbitrary input spaces; the suffix applies the same statement by removing coordinates.'))
 spec('prefix-coinfo',deterministic,[LAW,GATE,CO],[step('构造两层真实ReLU','Construct two actual ReLU layers',r'取$X=\pm1$等概率、$Y=1_{X=1}$。第一层预激活$X+2$恒正，门恒1，输出$t_1=X+2$；第二层预激活$t_1-2=X$，门为Y。没有额外随机性。',r'Let $X=\pm1$ with equal probability and $Y=1_{X=1}$. The first preactivation $X+2$ is always positive, with constant gate one and output $t_1=X+2$. The second preactivation is $t_1-2=X$, whose gate equals Y. There is no additional randomness.',r'\Sigma_1=1,\quad\Sigma_2=Y',['first_relu_gate_constant','second_relu_gate_label']),step('计算两个三元信息值','Compute both co-information values',r'常数门与Y的MI为0，扩展门$(1,Y)$与Y的MI为$\log2$。两者由X确定，因此相应co-information也是0与$\log2>0$；原附录第三≥子句不成立。原Eq11≤0和正文increase方向仍正确。',r'The constant gate has MI zero with Y, while the extended gate $(1,Y)$ has MI $\log2$ with Y. Both are determined by X, so their co-information values are also zero and $\log2>0$. The appendix third ≥ clause fails. Equation (11) and the main increase direction remain correct.',r'0\not\ge\log2',['constant_gate_information','extended_relu_gate_information','relu_prefix_clause_counterexample'])],('只反驳B.2第三个≥子句，反例的门由原结构ReLU产生；不否定正文Property2或Eq11。','Only the third ≥ clause in B.2 is refuted, by gates produced by actual ReLU layers. Main Property 2 and Equation (11) are preserved.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 spec('total-correlation',finite_ass,[LAW,TC],[step('展开实际KL定义','Expand the actual KL definition',r'在每个正联合门原子上分解$\log[p(\sigma)/\prod_dp_d(\sigma_d)]$；零原子贡献0。联合熵项与KL中的$\log p(\sigma)$相消，留下边缘对数之和。',r'For every positive joint gate atom, split $\log[p(\sigma)/\prod_dp_d(\sigma_d)]$. Zero atoms contribute zero. The joint entropy cancels the joint log term in KL, leaving a sum of marginal log terms.'),step('按投影求边缘熵','Sum by marginal projection',r'将有限和换序，并按$\sigma\mapsto\sigma_d$推前，得到每一项$-\sum_b p_d(b)\log p_d(b)=H(p_d)$。所以$H(\Sigma_l)+TC(\Sigma_l)=\sum_dH(\Sigma_l^d)=C_l$；这是任意有限维二值门律的精确恒等式。',r'Interchange the finite sums and push forward along $\sigma\mapsto\sigma_d$. Each term becomes $-\sum_b p_d(b)\log p_d(b)=H(p_d)$. Therefore $H(\Sigma_l)+TC(\Sigma_l)=\sum_dH(\Sigma_l^d)=C_l$, exactly for every finite-dimensional binary gate law.',r'H(\Sigma_l)+TC(\Sigma_l)=C_l',['push_expectation','total_correlation_entropy_identity'])],('实际门联合律、边缘乘积正规性、支撑与完整多元KL熵恒等式已验证；近似激活率解释另列。','The actual joint gate law, normalization of the marginal product, support and complete multivariate KL/entropy identity are verified. Approximate activation-rate interpretation is separate.'))
 spec('input-correlation',finite_ass,[LAW,GATE,TC],[step('保留真实条件熵项','Retain the actual conditional entropy',r'按有限门输出MI定义$I(X;\Sigma_l)=H(\Sigma_l)-H(\Sigma_l\mid X)$；不给随机层的条件熵擅自赋0。用Eq16精确熵/TC恒等式，直接相减得到Eq17。',r'Define finite-output MI as $I(X;\Sigma_l)=H(\Sigma_l)-H(\Sigma_l\mid X)$; the conditional entropy is retained for random layers. Subtract it from the exact Equation (16) identity to obtain Equation (17).',r'I(X;\Sigma_l)+TC(\Sigma_l)=C_l-H(\Sigma_l\mid X)',['information_correlation_identity']),zerostep],('一般随机门情形验证含真实条件熵残差的代数恒等式；无随机性时真实确定性核把该残差消去。','For random gates, the algebraic identity retains the actual conditional entropy residual; the actual deterministic kernel eliminates it in the no-randomness case.'))
 spec('conditional-correlation',deterministic+finite_ass,[LAW,GATE,CO,TC],[step('按标签条件化实际门律','Condition the actual gate law by labels',r'由同一$P(Y,\Sigma_l)$分解出每类门条件律；零概率类别贡献0。对每个条件律使用完整$H+TC=C$并按类别概率加权，得到$H(\Sigma_l\mid Y)+TC(\Sigma_l\mid Y)=C_{l\mid Y}$。',r'Disintegrate the same $P(Y,\Sigma_l)$ into class-conditioned gate laws, with zero-mass classes contributing zero. Apply the full $H+TC=C$ identity in each class and weight by class probabilities to get $H(\Sigma_l\mid Y)+TC(\Sigma_l\mid Y)=C_{l\mid Y}$.',r'H(\Sigma_l\mid Y)+TC(\Sigma_l\mid Y)=C_{l\mid Y}',['actual_conditional_entropy','conditional_correlation_identity']),step('相减并使用确定性','Subtract and use determinism',r'原Eq18使用$I(X;\Sigma_l;Y)=I(X;\Sigma_l)-I(X;\Sigma_l\mid Y)$。确定性使$H(\Sigma_l\mid X)=H(\Sigma_l\mid X,Y)=0$。将全局和条件两条恒等式相减，得到Eq22。标签/门实际联合律上的完整等式由Lean验证。',r'Equation (18) uses $I(X;\Sigma_l;Y)=I(X;\Sigma_l)-I(X;\Sigma_l\mid Y)$. Determinism gives $H(\Sigma_l\mid X)=H(\Sigma_l\mid X,Y)=0$. Subtract the global and conditional identities to obtain Equation (22). Lean verifies the complete identity on the actual label/gate joint law.',r'I(X;\Sigma_l;Y)=(C_l-C_{l\mid Y})-(TC(\Sigma_l)-TC(\Sigma_l\mid Y))',['label_information_correlation_identity','deterministic_gate_co_information_eq'])],('确定性原前提下Eq18–22的有限标签/门精确恒等式已验证；similar activation rates导致rough correlation的额外经验解释另列，不当精确定理。','Under the source deterministic premise, the finite label/gate identities in Equations (18)–(22) are verified. The rough-correlation interpretation from similar activation rates is recorded separately and is not an exact theorem.'))
 # Estimator clauses: actual source-model counterexamples, retaining false signs.
 spec('kde-input',[(r'作者外引连续Gaussian混合模型：$\widehat T=T+\epsilon$，各分量同正方差；P个训练样本取均匀权重。',r'The author cites a continuous Gaussian-mixture model $\widehat T=T+\epsilon$, with common positive component variance and uniform weights on P training samples.')],[KDE],[step('记录外引加噪模型','Record the externally cited noisy model',r'源Eq23讨论连续加噪特征$\widehat T$，并把距离核式归于Kolchinsky/Tracey等外部研究。正式文件没有该上界的独立本地作者证明。',r'Equation (23) concerns the continuously smoothed feature $\widehat T$ and attributes the distance-kernel bound to external work by Kolchinsky/Tracey and others. The selected formal file gives no independent local proof of this bound.'),step('保留外引范围','Retain the external scope',r'此条完整保留作者模型和所引上界，但不把它当作已形式化的离散门熵定理。后续离散门上界是否成立由各条独立反例判断。',r'This entry retains the author model and cited bound, without claiming a formalized discrete-gate entropy theorem. The later discrete-gate bounds are assessed separately by their own counterexamples.')],('原外引连续Gaussian混合MI上界已完整登记；其外部证明尚未形式化，本文无本地证明。','The externally cited continuous Gaussian-mixture MI bound is fully registered; its external proof is not formalized and this paper gives no local proof.'),'statement_scope_explanation','scope_under_review')
 get('kde-input')['original_proof_md']='**Project source note (not author text):** Equation (23) is attributed to external studies; this formal file provides no separate proof.';get('kde-input')['original_proof_source_type']='no_local_author_proof';get('kde-input')['original_proof_refs']=[]
 spec('kde-labels',[(r'$P=2$、两类各一例；连续特征段$\sigma_0^2>0$。原Eq24的外层和类内核和均使用字面$1/P$，不改成$1/P_l$。',r'$P=2$ with one example in each of two classes, and $\sigma_0^2>0$ in the continuous-feature section. Keep the literal $1/P$ in both the outer class sum and the class kernel sum, without replacing it by $1/P_l$.')],[LAW,KDE],[step('取真实常数ReLU特征','Choose an actual constant ReLU feature',r'令层权重0、偏置1，两个输入的特征均$t_i=\operatorname{ReLU}(1)=1$；类别各半。添加独立Gaussian噪声后$\widehat T=1+\epsilon$仍独立于Y，故真实MI为0。任意概率特征律下常数标签条件核的MI0计算已验证。',r'Set the layer weight to zero and bias to one, so both features are $t_i=\operatorname{ReLU}(1)=1$, with balanced labels. After independent Gaussian noise, $\widehat T=1+\epsilon$ remains independent of Y and its true MI is zero. The zero-MI calculation for the constant label kernel is verified for any probability feature law.',r'I(\widehat T;Y)=0',['independent_continuous_feature_label_information_zero']),step('代入原双重归一化','Evaluate the literal double normalization',r'所有核都是1。全局项为$-\log1=0$；每类括号为$-(1/2)\log(1/2)$，再乘类权重1/2并求和。原RHS为$-(1/2)\log2<0$，既不是真实MI等式也不是其上界。反例不要求特征区分类别，源也无此要求。',r'Every kernel is one. The global term is $-\log1=0$. Each class bracket is $-(1/2)\log(1/2)$, then weighted by one half. The printed RHS is $-(1/2)\log2<0$, so it is neither the true MI nor an upper bound. The source does not require features to distinguish labels.',r'\operatorname{RHS}_{24}=-\tfrac12\log2<0',['printed_constant_feature_estimator_negative'])],('反驳原Eq24的字面等式/upper-bound子句，真实独立条件核MI0和负打印核值均已验证；Gaussian独立生成的分布连接在人读步骤给出。','The literal equality/upper-bound clause of Equation (24) is refuted. Both zero MI for the independent conditional kernel and the negative printed kernel expression are verified; generation by independent Gaussian noise is explained in the readable steps.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 binaryass=[(r'真实ReLU门$\Sigma=1_{X>0}$，$X=\pm1$等概率；门均值1/2、方差1/4、源带宽$h=\kappa/4>0$。',r'The actual ReLU gate is $\Sigma=1_{X>0}$ for equiprobable $X=\pm1$. Its mean is one half, variance one quarter, and source bandwidth $h=\kappa/4>0$.')]
 binsteps=[step('核对门律与原带宽','Check the gate law and source bandwidth',r'门为等概率0/1，真实熵$\log2$、方差1/4。因此原$\sigma_0^2=\kappa\operatorname{Var}(\Sigma)$确实为$\kappa/4$，不使用自由带宽或零方差。',r'The gate is a balanced binary variable with true entropy $\log2$ and variance one quarter. Thus the source bandwidth $\sigma_0^2=\kappa\operatorname{Var}(\Sigma)$ is exactly $\kappa/4$, without a free bandwidth or a zero-variance degeneracy.',r'\operatorname{Var}(\Sigma)=1/4',['scalar_gate_mean','scalar_gate_variance','bit_entropy']),step('比较自核与跨状态核','Compare self and cross-state kernels',r'每个样本核平均为$[1+\exp(-2/\kappa)]/2$。所以估计值$\log2-\log(1+\exp(-2/\kappa))$严格小于$\log2$，因为跨状态核严格正。',r'Each average kernel is $[1+\exp(-2/\kappa)]/2$. Hence the estimate is $\log2-\log(1+\exp(-2/\kappa))<\log2$, since the cross-state kernel is strictly positive.',r'\widehat H=\log2-\log(1+e^{-2/\kappa})<H(\Sigma)',['binary_gate_kde_formula','variance_bandwidth_kde_counterexample'])]
 spec('kde-gates',binaryass,[LAW,KDE],binsteps,('在实际ReLU门及原κVar带宽下反驳Eq25的离散熵上界；完整核估计、方差、真实熵比较已验证。','Equation (25) is refuted for an actual ReLU gate with the original κVar bandwidth. The full kernel estimate, variance and true entropy comparison are verified.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 spec('kde-randomness',[(r'$X,B$独立Bernoulli(1/2)，B是dropout掩码；$\Sigma=1_{\operatorname{ReLU}(XB)>0}=XB$，移除dropout得$\widehat\Sigma=X$；取原允许$\kappa=16$。',r'$X,B$ are independent Bernoulli one-half variables, with B the dropout mask. The gate is $\Sigma=1_{\operatorname{ReLU}(XB)>0}=XB$; removing dropout gives $\widehat\Sigma=X$. Choose the allowed source constant $\kappa=16$.')],[LAW,KDE],[step('构造额外随机性的真实门','Construct a gate with actual additional randomness',r'四个等概率$(X,B)$状态推前到$(X,\Sigma)$得到质量$1/2,0,1/4,1/4$。dropout后ReLU确实产生该门，移除dropout得到X；这符合Eq26含额外随机性的前提。',r'Push forward the four equally likely $(X,B)$ states to $(X,\Sigma)$, giving masses $1/2,0,1/4,1/4$. ReLU after dropout produces precisely this gate, and removing dropout gives X. This meets the additional-randomness premise of Equation (26).',r'\Sigma=X B,\quad\widehat\Sigma=X',['dropout_relu_gate','removed_dropout_gate','dropout_relu_actual_law']),step('代入实际方差并严格比较','Use the actual variance and compare strictly',r'$\operatorname{Var}(\Sigma)=3/16$，故原带宽$16(3/16)=3$。真实$I(X;\Sigma)=(3/4)\log(4/3)\ge3/16$；移除采样后的二值核估计在h=3时不超过1/6，且$1/6<3/16$。',r'The variance is $\operatorname{Var}(\Sigma)=3/16$, so the original bandwidth is $16(3/16)=3$. The true information is $I(X;\Sigma)=(3/4)\log(4/3)\ge3/16$, while the removed-sampling binary kernel estimate at h=3 is at most one sixth, strictly below three sixteenths.',r'\widehat H_3\le1/6<3/16\le I(X;\Sigma)',['dropout_relu_variance','dropout_relu_information','binary_kde_three_upper','additional_randomness_kde_counterexample'])],('Eq26在其额外随机性前提下被实际独立dropout-ReLU模型反驳；真实联合律、MI、原方差带宽与核值比较全部验证。','Equation (26) is refuted under its additional-randomness premise by an actual independent dropout/ReLU model. Its joint law, MI, source variance bandwidth and kernel comparison are all verified.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 spec('kde-coinfo',binaryass+[(r'取标签Y等于门，$n=M=2$、每类恰一个样本，因此原$p_m=n_m/M=1/2$在此例已经正规；给定X无随机性。',r'Take Y equal to the gate, with $n=M=2$ and one sample per class. The source weights $p_m=n_m/M=1/2$ are normalized in this example, and there is no randomness given X.')],[LAW,GATE,CO,KDE],[binsteps[0],step('精确计算类别条件核','Compute the class-conditional kernels',r'各类只有一个门状态，自核为1，类条件KDE为$-\log1=0$。确定性给$I(\Sigma;Y\mid X)=0$，真实co-information为$I(\Sigma;Y)=\log2$。',r'Each class contains one gate state, whose self kernel is one and class KDE is $-\log1=0$. Determinism gives $I(\Sigma;Y\mid X)=0$, and the true co-information is $I(\Sigma;Y)=\log2$.',r'\widehat H(\Sigma\mid Y)=0',['singleton_class_kernel_zero','same_bit_information']),step('反驳正规类别权重情形','Refute even normalized class weights',r'原RHS于是退化全局二值KDE，严格小于真实$\log2$。该反例不借助一般$p_m=n_m/M$的归一化错误；该错误另列。',r'The source RHS reduces to the global binary KDE, strictly below the true $\log2$. This counterexample does not rely on the separate general normalization error in $p_m=n_m/M$.',r'\operatorname{RHS}_{27}<I(X;\Sigma;Y)',['normalized_class_co_information_bound_counterexample'])],('Eq27的原上界被反驳，即使n=M2使作者类别权重正规；单类核、真实MI与完整RHS比较已验证。','Equation (27) is refuted even when n=M=2 normalizes the author class weights. Class kernels, true MI and the full RHS comparison are verified.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 spec('kde-tc',[(r'两维门都为$1_{X>0}$，四个等权样本门为00,00,11,11；合成样本00,01,10,11恰是独立边缘乘积，激活率均1/2，原$h=\kappa/2>0$。',r'Both gates equal $1_{X>0}$. Four equally weighted samples have gates 00,00,11,11. Synthesized states 00,01,10,11 are exactly the product of the marginals, each with activation rate one half. The source bandwidth is $h=\kappa/2>0$.')],[LAW,TC,KDE],[step('匹配真实与合成分布','Match actual and synthesized laws',r'真实联合律$p_{00}=p_{11}=1/2$的TC为$\log2$。合成分布在四个二值状态上均匀，确实独立且逐坐标激活率与真实门一致。向量平方方差为1/2，故h为κ/2。',r'The true law $p_{00}=p_{11}=1/2$ has TC $\log2$. The synthesized law is uniform on all four binary states, hence independent with exactly the true coordinate activation rates. The squared vector variance is one half, so h is κ/2.',r'TC(p)=\log2,\quad q=\operatorname{Bern}(1/2)^{\otimes2}',['same_bit_information','same_bit_vector_variance']),step('计算每个实际核比','Compute each actual kernel ratio',r'令$t=\exp[-1/(2h)]>0$。对于真实00或11状态，分子为$2(1+t^2)$，分母为$1+2t+t^2=(1+t)^2$。四项相同，所以Eq29 RHS为$\log[2(1+t^2)/(1+t)^2]$。',r'Let $t=\exp[-1/(2h)]>0$. At each actual state 00 or 11, the numerator is $2(1+t^2)$ and denominator $1+2t+t^2=(1+t)^2$. All four terms agree, so the Equation (29) RHS is $\log[2(1+t^2)/(1+t)^2]$.',r'\operatorname{RHS}_{29}=\log\frac{2(1+t^2)}{(1+t)^2}',['gate_kernel_sums','four_point_tc_formula']),step('严格比较真实KL','Compare with the true KL strictly',r'由于$2t>0$，比值严格小于2；log单调，故原核比上界严格小于真实TC=$\log2$。这是精确有限样本和精确边缘乘积，不是合成分布Monte Carlo误差。',r'Since $2t>0$, the ratio is strictly below two. Monotonicity of log makes the printed kernel bound smaller than the true TC $\log2$. Both the finite sample law and marginal product are exact, so this is not synthesis Monte Carlo error.',r'\operatorname{RHS}_{29}<\log2=TC(p)',['exact_synthesis_tc_counterexample','source_bandwidth_tc_counterexample'])],('Eq29明示upper-bound子句由真实双ReLU门和精确独立合成分布反驳；完整距离核/原方差/比值/真实KL比较已验证。','The explicit upper-bound clause of Equation (29) is refuted by actual paired ReLU gates and an exact independent synthesized law. Distances, source variance, kernel ratios and true KL comparison are verified.'),'counterexample','refuted')
 # EBM exact identities, smooth approximation and stochastic algorithm scope.
 spec('ebm-normalization',[(r'门状态有限；$q$正规且$f$实值，不要求所有q原子正。只在q正支撑上写能量$-\log q-f$。',r'The gate state space is finite, q is normalized and f real. Not every q atom must be positive. The energy $-\log q-f$ is stated on positive prior support.')],[EBM],[step('证明配分函数正','Prove the partition is positive',r'正规先验至少一个原子正，指数对任意实数严格正，所以该项严格正且其他项非负，$Z>0$。求和$qe^f/Z$得到1，构成真实EBM概率律。',r'A normalized prior has a positive atom. Its exponential is strictly positive and every other term nonnegative, so $Z>0$. Summing $qe^f/Z$ gives one and constructs the actual EBM law.',r'Z>0,\quad\sum_s p_\theta(s)=1',['law_has_positive_mass','partition_pos','ebmLaw']),step('在真实支撑上取对数','Take the logarithm on the true support',r'q(s)>0处，$\log p_\theta(s)=f_\theta(s)+\log q(s)-\log Z$，即作者能量形式。q(s)=0处模型概率0，不把Lean的总化log0解释成有限概率能量。',r'Where q(s)>0, $\log p_\theta(s)=f_\theta(s)+\log q(s)-\log Z$, giving the author energy form. At q(s)=0 the model probability is zero; the totalized Lean log at zero is not interpreted as finite probabilistic energy.',r'\log p_\theta=f_\theta+\log q-\log Z',['ebm_log_mass'])],('完整有限状态EBM正规化和正支撑能量恒等式已验证，包含零概率先验状态。','Full finite-state EBM normalization and the energy identity on positive support are verified, including zero-probability prior states.'))
 spec('ebm-mle',[(r'EBM更新时DNN门数据与先验q冻结；参数空间可为任意实赋范空间，所有有限状态分数Fréchet可微。经验律r正规。q取真实r边缘乘积时无需额外正率假设。',r'During the EBM update, DNN gate data and the prior q are frozen. Parameters may lie in any real normed space; every finite-state score is Fréchet differentiable. The empirical law r is normalized. If q is its actual marginal product, no extra positive-rate assumption is needed.')],[EBM],[step('连接真实似然与展开损失','Connect true likelihood with the expanded loss',r'正经验原子推出所有对应边缘原子正，所以边缘乘积q在r支撑上正。逐原子使用log概率恒等式，零经验原子贡献0，得真实$-E_r\log p_\theta=\log Z-E_r(f+\log q)$；激活率0/1不需排除。',r'A positive empirical joint atom has positive corresponding marginals, so their product q is positive on the support of r. Apply the log-probability identity there, with zero empirical atoms contributing zero, to obtain the true $-E_r\log p_\theta=\log Z-E_r(f+\log q)$. Activation rates zero and one remain allowed.',r'-E_r\log p_\theta=\log Z-E_r(f+\log q)',['product_coordinate_support','ebm_nll_eq_negative_log_probability','empirical_marginal_prior_nll']),step('求导实际有限配分和','Differentiate the actual finite partition sum',r'有限求和可逐项Fréchet求导，$dZ=\sum_sq(s)e^{f_s}df_s$。因Z>0，$d\log Z=\sum_s p_\theta(s)df_s$。这里q冻结，未把所需梯度公式放进假设。',r'Differentiate the finite sum term by term: $dZ=\sum_sq(s)e^{f_s}df_s$. Since Z>0, $d\log Z=\sum_s p_\theta(s)df_s$. The prior is frozen, and the desired gradient formula is not a hypothesis.',r'd\log Z=E_{p_\theta}df',['partition_hasFDerivAt','log_partition_hasFDerivAt']),step('减去经验分数导数','Subtract empirical score derivatives',r'对真实负对数似然展开式求导，得到$dL=E_{p_\theta}df-E_rdf$。原Eq34的正log最大化与Eq35的负log最小化等价，但作者把两者同写L，原记号冲突保留另列。',r'Differentiate the expanded true negative log likelihood to obtain $dL=E_{p_\theta}df-E_rdf$. Maximizing the positive log likelihood in Equation (34) is equivalent to minimizing its negative in Equation (35), but the author reuses L with opposite signs; this notation conflict is recorded separately.',r'dL=E_{p_\theta}df-E_rdf',['ebm_nll_hasFDerivAt'])],('真实负log概率损失连接及任意实参数空间Fréchet梯度完整验证；原正/负L符号冲突单列，不涉及改变目标。','The true negative-log-probability loss and its Fréchet gradient on arbitrary real parameter spaces are fully verified. The original positive/negative L notation conflict is recorded separately.'))
 smoothass=[(r'按作者Eq41–42采用连续松弛，不把离散二值门函数当可微。EBM与其Z、先验系数在DNN更新时冻结；局部状态分数和状态映射可微，各先验因子在求导点严格正。',r'Use the author continuous relaxation in Equations (41)–(42), without treating the exact binary gate as differentiable. The EBM, Z and prior coefficients are frozen during the DNN update. The local state score and state map are differentiable and each prior factor is positive at the differentiation point.')]
 spec('ebm-langevin',smoothass,[EBM,(r'连续能量$E(s)=-f(s)-\sum_d\log q_d(s)$，在各因子正的域上可微。原离散EBM与此连续近似是不同状态空间。',r'The continuous energy $E(s)=-f(s)-\sum_d\log q_d(s)$ is differentiable on the domain where each prior factor is positive. The original discrete EBM and this continuous approximation have different state spaces.')],[step('展开正值域内的能量导数','Expand the energy derivative on its positive domain',r'冻结参数后，链式规则给$-dE=df+\sum_dq_d^{-1}dq_d$，这解释Eq37第二行漂移项。源Eq41/42已经明示连续近似，不能称作者没有松弛。',r'With parameters frozen, the chain rule gives $-dE=df+\sum_dq_d^{-1}dq_d$, explaining the drift in the second line of Equation (37). Equations (41)–(42) explicitly provide a continuous approximation; the source does supply a relaxation.',r'-dE=df+\sum_dq_d^{-1}dq_d',['frozen_state_loss_hasFDerivAt']),step('区分一步公式与采样保证','Separate the step formula from sampling guarantees',r'添加Gaussian噪声给原更新算法，但有限步是否采到目标EBM没有在此证明。线性先验在s∈[0,1]且0<p̂<1时正，未约束Gaussian步可离开该域；例如p̂=3/4,s=−1时q=−1/4。这是具体域边界，不是否定作者已给的sigmoid松弛。',r'Adding Gaussian noise gives the source update algorithm, but target-EBM sampling after finitely many steps is not proved here. The linear prior is positive for s∈[0,1] and 0<p̂<1, while an unconstrained Gaussian step may leave this domain; p̂=3/4 and s=−1 gives q=−1/4. This is a specific domain boundary, rather than denial of the stated sigmoid relaxation.',r'q_{3/4}(-1)=-1/4',['relaxed_prior_positive','relaxed_prior_outside_domain'])],('连续正值域内能量导数已验证；不声称离散状态Langevin导数、未约束采样全域合法性或MCMC收敛已证明。','The energy derivative on its continuous positive domain is verified. No exact derivative on discrete states, global legality of unconstrained sampling, or MCMC convergence is claimed.'),'partial_component','scope_under_review')
 spec('ebm-sampling-loss',[(r'作者Eq38首符号为≈。对后续等号只固定已经生成的真实/合成样本；EBM参数更新时两组状态与q冻结。',r'The first symbol in Equation (38) is ≈. For the following equality, fix the already generated real and synthesized samples. Both state collections and q are frozen during the EBM parameter update.')],[EBM],[step('保留模型期望的近似','Retain the expectation approximation',r'用合成样本平均近似$E_{p_\theta}df$，源≈保留。这不是任意有限MCMC样本与模型期望的精确等式。',r'The synthesized-sample mean approximates $E_{p_\theta}df$, retaining the author ≈. It is not an exact equality for arbitrary finite MCMC samples.'),step('验证冻结样本的梯度等式','Verify the gradient equality for frozen samples',r'固定两组状态后，有限求和求导给$E_{\widetilde r}df-E_rdf$。q不依赖θ，两组能量差中的logq导数为0，故它等于作者第二行能量差的参数导数。',r'For frozen state collections, differentiating the finite sums gives $E_{\widetilde r}df-E_rdf$. Since q does not depend on θ, log-q derivatives in the energy difference vanish, giving the parameter derivative in the author second line.',r'd(E_rE_\theta-E_{\widetilde r}E_\theta)=E_{\widetilde r}df-E_rdf',['frozen_monte_carlo_derivative'])],('仅Eq38在冻结采样状态后的精确梯度等式已验证；首≈和采样误差/收敛没有改成等号。','Only the exact gradient equality in Equation (38) after freezing sampled states is verified. The initial ≈ and sampling error/convergence are not replaced by equality.'),'partial_component','scope_under_review')
 spec('ebm-cross-entropy',[(r'真实门律r与拟合EBM律p可不同，p在r真支撑上正；由真实边缘乘积先验及实分数可满足该条件。',r'The true gate law r may differ from the fitted EBM law p, which is positive on the actual support of r. An actual marginal-product prior and real scores satisfy that support condition.')],[LAW,EBM],[step('展开实际模型负对数','Expand the actual negative model logarithm',r'冻结拟合参数后，$-E_r\log p=E_r(E+\log Z)$，等于原Eq39的经验模型损失。若E_r是n个样本均值，有限求和即原双层/样本和。',r'With fitted parameters frozen, $-E_r\log p=E_r(E+\log Z)$, giving the empirical model loss in Equation (39). Taking E_r as the average of n samples yields the source layer/sample double sum.',r'-E_r\log p=E_rE+\log Z',['ebm_nll_eq_negative_log_probability']),step('保留拟合误差的KL项','Retain the fitting-error KL term',r'真实交叉熵分解为$-E_r\log p=H(r)+D_{KL}(r\Vert p)$。所以它是拟合模型的交叉熵，只有KL=0时等于原Eq30真实门熵；作者明确称EBM用于approximate。不把训练后模型等于真律作为已证结论。',r'The true cross entropy satisfies $-E_r\log p=H(r)+D_{KL}(r\Vert p)$. It is the fitted-model cross entropy and equals the true gate entropy in Equation (30) only when KL vanishes. The author states that the EBM approximates the law; exact fitting is not a proved conclusion.',r'-E_r\log p=H(r)+D_{KL}(r\Vert p)',['cross_entropy_decomposition'])],('真实模型交叉熵/能量展开及H+KL分解已验证；不证明拟合分布等于原门分布，因此Eq30到39作为替代损失范围登记。','The actual model cross-entropy/energy expansion and H+KL decomposition are verified. Equality of the fitted and true gate distributions is not proved, so the transition from Equation (30) to (39) is recorded as a surrogate-loss scope.'),'partial_component','scope_under_review')
 spec('ebm-dnn-gradient',smoothass,[EBM],[step('固定参数与归一化项','Freeze the model and normalization',r'按作者最后交替训练段，DNN更新时θ_f冻结，源还明确将Z视常数；固定的先验系数也不沿该步更新。把每个样本平滑门写为$s_i(\theta)$，目标是冻结模型的负log概率均值。',r'The author final alternating-training paragraph freezes θ_f during the DNN update, and explicitly treats Z as constant. Prior coefficients are also fixed for this derivative. Write each smooth sample gate as $s_i(\theta)$; the objective is the mean negative log probability of this frozen model.'),step('对门映射使用链式规则','Apply the chain rule through the gate map',r'对$f(s_i(\theta))$和各正先验因子的$\log q_d(s_i(\theta))$使用Fréchet链式规则，得到负分数导数与$-q_d^{-1}dq_d$，再复合$ds_i$并按有限样本/层求和，正是Eq40范围内梯度。',r'Apply the Fréchet chain rule to $f(s_i(\theta))$ and each positive factor $\log q_d(s_i(\theta))$. This gives the negative score derivative and $-q_d^{-1}dq_d$, composed with $ds_i$ and summed over the finite samples/layers, exactly the scope of Equation (40).',r'd\mathcal L_i=-(df+\sum_dq_d^{-1}dq_d)\circ ds_i',['frozen_state_loss_hasFDerivAt'])],('原冻结EBM/连续正值域假设下单状态完整Fréchet链式导数已验证；有限层/样本和人读完成，非离散硬门精确导数。','The complete single-state Fréchet chain derivative is verified under the source frozen-EBM/continuous-positive-domain conditions. The finite layer/sample sum is completed in the readable proof; it is not an exact derivative of hard binary gates.'),'partial_component','no_statement_error_recorded')
 spec('ebm-relaxation',[(r'按原作者≈采用sigmoid/Swish与线性q连续近似；β为实数。线性q正值域结果取0<p̂<1、s∈[0,1]，不将其加入原离散门命题。',r'Use the original ≈ for the sigmoid/Swish and linear-q continuous approximations, with real β. The positive-domain result uses 0<p̂<1 and s∈[0,1], without adding these conditions to the original discrete-gate statement.')],[(r'定义松弛$\widetilde\sigma(x)=\operatorname{sigmoid}(\beta x)$、$\widetilde R(x)=x\widetilde\sigma(x)$、$\widetilde q_p(s)=1-p+s(2p-1)$。它们是作者明说的近似模型，不等同于有限β硬ReLU/二值prior。',r'Define $\widetilde\sigma(x)=\operatorname{sigmoid}(\beta x)$, $\widetilde R(x)=x\widetilde\sigma(x)$ and $\widetilde q_p(s)=1-p+s(2p-1)$. These are the author stated approximations, rather than exact hard ReLU/binary prior at finite β.')],[step('求sigmoid门与Swish导数','Differentiate the sigmoid gate and Swish',r'$\widetilde\sigma$严格在(0,1)，导数为$\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$。乘积规则给$\partial_x\widetilde R=\widetilde\sigma+x\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$。这些是所选连续近似的精确导数，不把源≈改等号。',r'The relaxed gate lies strictly in (0,1), with derivative $\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$. The product rule gives $\partial_x\widetilde R=\widetilde\sigma+x\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$. These are exact derivatives of the chosen approximation, without changing the source ≈ to equality.',r'\partial_x\widetilde\sigma=\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)',['sigmoid_gate_hasDerivAt','swish_hasDerivAt']),step('核对prior端点与正值域','Check prior endpoints and positive domain',r'线性prior在s=0,1分别为1−p和p，导数恒2p−1；它是两端值的凸组合，所以0<p<1且0≤s≤1时正，sigmoid门满足该域。s=−1,p=3/4使q负，故此延拓未自动成为全实线上的连续概率密度。',r'The linear prior equals 1−p and p at s=0 and one, with constant derivative 2p−1. It is their convex combination and is positive when 0<p<1 and 0≤s≤1; sigmoid gates satisfy this domain. At s=−1,p=3/4 it is negative, so this extension is not automatically a probability density on the entire real line.',r'\partial_s\widetilde q_p=2p-1',['relaxed_prior_endpoints','relaxed_prior_hasDerivAt','relaxed_prior_sigmoid_positive','relaxed_prior_outside_domain'])],('完整验证作者所选连续近似的精确导数、prior端点与正值域；硬门近似误差或β极限收敛没有形式化。','Exact derivatives, prior endpoints and the positive domain of the author continuous approximation are fully verified. Approximation error for hard gates or convergence as β grows is not formalized.'),'partial_component','scope_under_review')
 spec('ebm-alternating',[],[EBM],[step('依次固定两套参数','Freeze each parameter set in turn',r'每批先用Eq38更新EBM，原DNN参数冻结；更新DNN时EBM参数冻结。此处是作者实现算法说明，沒有交替训练收敛定理。',r'For each batch, update the EBM by Equation (38) while freezing the original DNN; freeze the EBM during the DNN update. This is the author implementation algorithm, with no alternating-training convergence theorem.')],('完整作者算法记录；不是证明目标，参数冻结规则用于MLE与DNN梯度的局部适配。','Complete author algorithm record; it is not a proof target. Its freeze rules are used in the local likelihood and DNN-gradient adapters.'),'source_material')
 spec('activation-heuristics',[(r'精确Eq2/16不需相似激活率；原后续roughconstant/negativecorrelation解释需区分平均率与逐坐标率，以及条件类别率。',r'Exact Equations (2)/(16) do not need similar activation rates. Subsequent rough-constant/negative-correlation interpretations distinguish averaged rates, coordinate rates and class-conditioned rates.')],[LAW,TC],[step('限定平均率反例的位置','Locate the averaged-rate failure precisely',r'$(1/2,1/2)$与$(0,1)$平均率都是1/2，但$C$分别2log2与0。因此PDF5由平均率收敛推出roughly constant不能仅由均值成立。此反例不否定PDF15逐坐标相似$a_l^d$或PDF6逐维实验。',r'Rates (1/2,1/2) and (0,1) both average to one half, but C is respectively 2log2 and zero. Thus the page-5 inference from an average rate to a roughly constant C does not follow from that average alone. This does not refute page-15 coordinate-wise similarity or page-6 per-dimension experiments.'),step('保留条件类别率的经验限定','Retain class-conditioned empirical qualifications',r'原Appendix C明确给标签稀少/无泛化等例外；D的直观例子和实验观察不能当全网络定理。给定相同C或相同C−C|Y时精确恒等式提供反向关系，但“相似”程度的定量误差需另证。',r'Appendix C explicitly gives exceptions such as scarce labels and lack of generalization. Appendix D intuition and experimental observations are not universal network theorems. At exactly fixed C or C−C|Y the identities give an inverse relation; quantitative error from merely similar values needs a separate proof.')],('激活率的近似经验解释完整登记；平均率推断缺口限定PDF5，不扩大到精确熵恒等式或逐坐标假设。','The approximate empirical interpretation is fully registered. The average-rate gap is confined to page 5 and does not extend to exact entropy identities or coordinate-wise premises.'),'statement_scope_explanation','scope_under_review')
 spec('external-theorems',[],[],[step('保留原外引假设与对象','Retain the cited objects and premises',r'原文分开一层sign网络、两层ReLU网络、固定输入维数的一隐层算法及最大表示复杂度；这些命题的计算任务和假设不同。各项在本篇只引用作者/年份，未给本地证明。',r'The source distinguishes one-layer sign networks, two-layer ReLU networks, one-hidden-layer learning at fixed input dimension, and maximal representation complexity. Their computational tasks and premises differ. This paper cites authors/years without local proofs.'),step('明确尚未形式化的外部范围','State the unformalized external scope',r'这些外部定理在检索与证明目标分母中保留。没有将本篇门控熵、KL或仿射层链引理冒充上述外部计算复杂度定理。',r'These external results remain searchable and included in the proof-target denominator. The gate-entropy, KL and affine-chain lemmas in this package are not presented as proofs of the external computational-complexity theorems.')],('外引陈述完整登记；外部原证明不在选定正式文件中，尚未形式化。','The cited statements are fully registered; the external proofs are outside the selected formal file and remain unformalized.'),'statement_scope_explanation','scope_under_review')
 empirical=get('external-and-experiments');empirical['kind']='empirical';empirical['original_statement_md']=r'The experiments compare transformation complexity, feature entanglement, layerwise inference, label size/capacity, robustness, transferability and consistency for the specified MNIST/CIFAR-10/CUB200-2011 networks. Figures 2–14 and Tables 1–3 report those concrete measurements. Appendix G.2 tests KDE stability/accuracy; G.3 compares binning; G.4–G.8 give activation rates, additional network experiments, transferability and consistency. These are empirical comparisons of the named models, datasets and samples.'
