 spec('regularizer-definition',[(r'$\lambda>0$；真实门分布p定义熵目标，实际拟合EBM替代另列，不默认其等于p。',r'$\lambda>0$; the true gate law p defines the entropy objective. The fitted-EBM surrogate is separate and is not assumed equal to p.')],[LAW,EBM],[step('定义原正则化损失','Define the original regularized objective',r'原Eq4/30对各层真实门熵求和，再按λ加入原task loss。这是训练目标定义，本身不证明训练一定找到最小复杂度网络，也不保证泛化/鲁棒性改善。',r'Equations (4)/(30) sum the true gate entropies and add their λ-weighted value to the task loss. This defines a training objective, without proving that training finds a minimum-complexity network or guarantees improved generalization/robustness.')],('完整原损失定义；数学身份与拟合交叉熵替代、训练经验改进分开。','Complete source loss definition, distinct from the fitted cross-entropy surrogate and empirical training improvements.'),'source_material')
