 get('ebm-relaxation')['translations']['en']['proof_steps'][0]['body_md']=r'The relaxed gate $\widetilde\sigma$ lies strictly in (0,1), with derivative $\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$. The product rule gives $\partial_x\widetilde R=\widetilde\sigma+x\beta\widetilde\sigma(1-\widetilde\sigma)$. These are exact derivatives of the chosen approximation, without changing the source ≈ to equality.'
